# DRAW keymap preset: Pro Motion NG (Cosmigo)  (SAFEST — DRAW-free target keys only)
#
# Format: actionId keycode requireMods forbidMods [device button]
#   mods bits: 1=Ctrl 2=Shift 4=Alt.  Action ids: GUI/COMMAND.BM (CMD_init) / SHORTCUTS.md.
# Policy (Rick, "safest"): applied ONLY if the target key is UNBOUND in DRAW. Collisions
# are documented, not applied — decide them in PLANS/PRESETS-KEYMAP-DECISIONS.md.
#
# Pro Motion is a dedicated pixel-art tool; it shares much with DRAW/Aseprite
# conventions but uses several of its own single-letter tools.

# --- Safe remaps (target key free in DRAW: Ctrl+I/J/K/U/W) ---
# No distinctive Pro Motion free-key op that DRAW mirrors 1:1. (none)

# --- COLLISIONS (need a decision; NOT applied) -------------------------------
#   D   Dotted freehand     -> DRAW D is Dot tool (partial match)
#   K   Draw / continuous   -> DRAW K is Spray tool
#   F   Fill                -> DRAW F is Fill (match)
#   G   Gradient / grid     -> DRAW G is a grid chord initiator
#   L   Line                -> DRAW L is Line (match)
#   R   Rectangle           -> DRAW R is Rectangle (match)
#   C   Circle/Ellipse      -> DRAW C is Ellipse (match)
#   T   Text                -> DRAW T is Text (match)
#   Pro Motion already agrees with DRAW on F/L/R/C/T — no rows needed for those.
